# phpscript code coverage

Statement coverage of the Go packages, one row per package, with the cognitive complexity and the line count of each. [phpscript-detail.md](phpscript-detail.md) is the same run per function.

Status is OK at 80% of lines, or at a cognitive complexity under 5 with any coverage above zero. Complexity 0 has no branch: one call reaches every line.

